    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it happened. everything is just gone. the business, the house, all of it. i feel like i'm just falling and there's nothing to grab onto anymore. i can't even look at my friends or my family without feeling like a complete fraud. it's just... it's all going to end in such a pathetic way if i let it.",
